+    "task": "Napíš presne dve funkcie: `planSprint(stories, capacity)` a `validateStory(text)`.\n\n`planSprint(stories, capacity)` dostane pole stories v tvare `{ id, title, priority, points }`, kde priority je `must`, `should`, `could` alebo `wont`. Stories typu `wont` ignoruj. Zvyšné stories zoraď podľa priority presne v poradí `must`, `should`, `could`; potom podľa `points` vzostupne; potom podľa `id` bežným porovnaním reťazcov. Prechádzaj zoradený zoznam a vyber každú story, ktorej body sa ešte zmestia do zostávajúcej kapacity. Ak sa story nezmestí, preskoč ju a pokračuj ďalšou. Vráť `{ selected: [ids v poradí výberu], used: súčet bodov, leftover: [nevybrané ids okrem wont, v zoradenom poradí] }`. Ak samotný súčet bodov stories typu Must prekročí kapacitu, vyhoď Error, ktorého správa obsahuje `must`. Nemeň vstupné pole ani jeho objekty stories.\n\n`validateStory(text)` overí formát user story `As a <role>, I want <goal> so that <benefit>` bez ohľadu na veľkosť písmen. Začiatok môže byť `As a` aj `As an`. Text musí obsahovať oddeľovače `, I want ` a ` so that ` a rola, cieľ aj prínos musia byť po orezaní (trim) neprázdne. Vráť `{ valid: boolean, role, goal, benefit }`. Pri neplatnej story vráť `valid: false` a prázdne reťazce pre všetky tri časti.",
+    "kind": "js",
+    "starter": "function planSprint(stories, capacity) {\n  const sorted = [...stories].filter((story) => story.priority !== \"wont\");\n  const selected = [];\n  let used = 0;\n\n  for (const story of sorted) {\n    if (used + story.points <= capacity) {\n      selected.push(story.id);\n      used += story.points;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return {\n    selected,\n    used,\n    leftover: sorted.filter((story) => !selected.includes(story.id)).map((story) => story.id)\n  };\n}\n\nfunction validateStory(text) {\n  const match = /^as a (.+), i want (.+) so that (.+)$/i.exec(text);\n  if (!match) {\n    return { valid: false, role: \"\", goal: \"\", benefit: \"\" };\n  }\n\n  return {\n    valid: true,\n    role: match[1].trim(),\n    goal: match[2].trim(),\n    benefit: match[3].trim()\n  };\n}",
+    "solution": "function planSprint(stories, capacity) {\n  const priorityOrder = { must: 0, should: 1, could: 2 };\n  const eligible = stories.filter((story) => story.priority !== \"wont\");\n  const sorted = [...eligible].sort((a, b) => {\n    const priorityDifference = priorityOrder[a.priority] - priorityOrder[b.priority];\n    if (priorityDifference !== 0) return priorityDifference;\n    if (a.points !== b.points) return a.points - b.points;\n    return String(a.id).localeCompare(String(b.id));\n  });\n\n  const mustPoints = eligible\n    .filter((story) => story.priority === \"must\")\n    .reduce((sum, story) => sum + story.points, 0);\n\n  if (mustPoints > capacity) {\n    throw new Error(\"must stories exceed sprint capacity\");\n  }\n\n  const selected = [];\n  const selectedIds = new Set();\n  let used = 0;\n\n  for (const story of sorted) {\n    if (used + story.points <= capacity) {\n      selected.push(story.id);\n      selectedIds.add(story.id);\n      used += story.points;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return {\n    selected,\n    used,\n    leftover: sorted.filter((story) => !selectedIds.has(story.id)).map((story) => story.id)\n  };\n}\n\nfunction validateStory(text) {\n  if (typeof text !== \"string\") {\n    return { valid: false, role: \"\", goal: \"\", benefit: \"\" };\n  }\n\n  const match = /^as an?\\s+(.+?)\\s*,\\s*i want\\s+(.+?)\\s+so that\\s+(.+)$/i.exec(text);\n  if (!match) {\n    return { valid: false, role: \"\", goal: \"\", benefit: \"\" };\n  }\n\n  const role = match[1].trim();\n  const goal = match[2].trim();\n  const benefit = match[3].trim();\n\n  if (!role || !goal || !benefit) {\n    return { valid: false, role: \"\", goal: \"\", benefit: \"\" };\n  }\n\n  return { valid: true, role, goal, benefit };\n}",
+    "hint": "Pri `planSprint` rozdeľ problém na tri kroky: vyfiltruj a zoraď vhodné stories, ešte pred výberom vypočítaj súčet bodov typu Must a potom prechádzaj zoradený zoznam a sleduj spotrebovanú kapacitu. Pri `validateStory` dokáže rolu, cieľ aj prínos zachytiť jeden regulárny výraz bez ohľadu na veľkosť písmen, len nezabudni, že platné sú oba členy `a` aj `an` a že každá zachytená časť musí byť po orezaní neprázdna.",
+    "tests": [
+      {
+        "name": "Zoradí stories typu must, should a could v tomto poradí",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"c1\", title: \"Dashboard\", priority: \"could\", points: 1 },\n  { id: \"s1\", title: \"Tickets\", priority: \"should\", points: 1 },\n  { id: \"m1\", title: \"Login\", priority: \"must\", points: 1 }\n];\nconst result = planSprint(stories, 3);\nif (JSON.stringify(result.selected) !== JSON.stringify([\"m1\", \"s1\", \"c1\"])) throw new Error(\"Wrong priority order\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Stories s rovnakou prioritou zoradí podľa bodov a potom podľa id",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"b\", title: \"B\", priority: \"should\", points: 3 },\n  { id: \"c\", title: \"C\", priority: \"should\", points: 1 },\n  { id: \"a\", title: \"A\", priority: \"should\", points: 1 }\n];\nconst result = planSprint(stories, 10);\nif (JSON.stringify(result.selected) !== JSON.stringify([\"a\", \"c\", \"b\"])) throw new Error(\"Wrong tie-breaking order\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Preskočí story, ktorá sa nezmestí, a pokračuje ďalšími",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"m1\", title: \"Large must\", priority: \"must\", points: 3 },\n  { id: \"s1\", title: \"Too large\", priority: \"should\", points: 5 },\n  { id: \"s2\", title: \"Small enough\", priority: \"should\", points: 2 }\n];\nconst result = planSprint(stories, 5);\nif (JSON.stringify(result.selected) !== JSON.stringify([\"m1\", \"s2\"])) throw new Error(\"Did not skip oversized story correctly\");\nif (result.used !== 5) throw new Error(\"Wrong used points\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Ignoruje stories typu wont",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"m1\", title: \"Login\", priority: \"must\", points: 2 },\n  { id: \"w1\", title: \"Mobile app\", priority: \"wont\", points: 1 }\n];\nconst result = planSprint(stories, 3);\nif (JSON.stringify(result.selected) !== JSON.stringify([\"m1\"])) throw new Error(\"Wont story was selected\");\nif (result.leftover.length !== 0) throw new Error(\"Wont story appeared in leftover\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Vyhodí chybu, keď samotné stories typu must prekročia kapacitu",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"m1\", title: \"Login\", priority: \"must\", points: 3 },\n  { id: \"m2\", title: \"Orders\", priority: \"must\", points: 4 }\n];\nlet threw = false;\ntry {\n  planSprint(stories, 6);\n} catch (error) {\n  threw = error instanceof Error && error.message.toLowerCase().includes(\"must\");\n}\nif (!threw) throw new Error(\"Expected must-capacity error\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Zvyšné vhodné stories vráti v zoradenom poradí",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"s2\", title: \"S2\", priority: \"should\", points: 2 },\n  { id: \"m1\", title: \"M1\", priority: \"must\", points: 2 },\n  { id: \"s1\", title: \"S1\", priority: \"should\", points: 1 }\n];\nconst result = planSprint(stories, 2);\nif (JSON.stringify(result.selected) !== JSON.stringify([\"m1\"])) throw new Error(\"Wrong selected stories\");\nif (JSON.stringify(result.leftover) !== JSON.stringify([\"s1\", \"s2\"])) throw new Error(\"Wrong leftover order\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Nemení vstupné stories",
+        "code": "const stories = [\n  { id: \"b\", title: \"B\", priority: \"should\", points: 2 },\n  { id: \"a\", title: \"A\", priority: \"must\", points: 1 }\n];\nconst original = JSON.stringify(stories);\nplanSprint(stories, 3);\nif (JSON.stringify(stories) !== original) throw new Error(\"Input was mutated\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Overí štandardnú zákaznícku story",
+        "code": "const result = validateStory(\"As a customer, I want to view my orders so that I can track my purchases\");\nif (!result.valid) throw new Error(\"Expected valid story\");\nif (result.role !== \"customer\") throw new Error(\"Wrong role\");\nif (result.goal !== \"to view my orders\") throw new Error(\"Wrong goal\");\nif (result.benefit !== \"I can track my purchases\") throw new Error(\"Wrong benefit\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Akceptuje As an a nezáleží mu na veľkosti písmen",
+        "code": "const result = validateStory(\"AS AN ADMIN, I WANT to manage tickets SO THAT I can resolve customer issues\");\nif (!result.valid) throw new Error(\"Expected valid story\");\nif (result.role !== \"ADMIN\") throw new Error(\"Wrong role\");\nif (result.goal !== \"to manage tickets\") throw new Error(\"Wrong goal\");\nif (result.benefit !== \"I can resolve customer issues\") throw new Error(\"Wrong benefit\");\nreturn true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Odmietne chýbajúcu rolu, cieľ alebo prínos",
+        "code": "const invalid = [\n  \"As a , I want to view orders so that I can track purchases\",\n  \"As a customer, I want  so that I can track purchases\",\n  \"As a customer, I want to view orders so that \",\n  \"As a customer I want to view orders so that I can track purchases\"\n];\nfor (const text of invalid) {\n  const result = validateStory(text);\n  if (result.valid) throw new Error(`Expected invalid story: ${text}`);\n  if (result.role !== \"\" || result.goal !== \"\" || result.benefit !== \"\") throw new Error(\"Invalid result should contain empty parts\");\n}\nreturn true;"
+      },
