+    "task": "Napíš `runSuite(fn)` ako malú sadu testov v štýle mutačného testovania. Dodaná implementácia `fn` má signatúru `fn(price, customer)`, kde `customer` je `{ loyaltyYears: number, isEmployee: boolean }`. Správne pravidlá sú: zamestnanci dostanú zľavu 30 %; inak zákazníci s 10 a viac rokmi vernosti dostanú zľavu 15 %; inak zákazníci s 3 a viac rokmi vernosti dostanú zľavu 10 %; výsledok nesmie byť nikdy pod 0; výsledok sa zaokrúhľuje na 2 desatinné miesta; a záporná alebo nekonečná/neplatná (non-finite) cena musí vyhodiť `Error(\"Invalid price\")`. Tvoja `runSuite(fn)` musí spustiť tvoje vlastné asercie nad dodanou `fn` a vrátiť `true` iba vtedy, keď prejdú všetky asercie. Smie používať iba parameter `fn` a nikdy nesmie volať ani skúmať globálnu funkciu `priceWithDiscount`. Tvoja sada musí byť dosť silná na to, aby pre správnu implementáciu vrátila `true` a pre každú z týchto štyroch nenápadne pokazených implementácií `false`: jedna používa nesprávnu hranicu pre 3 roky vernosti, jedna zabúda na zaokrúhlenie, jedna ignoruje zľavu pre zamestnancov a jedna prijme zápornú cenu namiesto vyhodenia chyby. Zahrň testy pre dôležité hranice, správanie pri zamestnancoch, zaokrúhľovanie, neplatné ceny, nekonečné ceny a pravidlo nezáporného výsledku.",
+    "kind": "ts",
+    "starter": "function priceWithDiscount(price: number, customer: { loyaltyYears: number; isEmployee: boolean }): number {\n  if (!Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0) {\n    throw new Error(\"Invalid price\");\n  }\n\n  let discount = 0;\n\n  if (customer.isEmployee) {\n    discount = 0.30;\n  } else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) {\n    discount = 0.15;\n  } else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 3) {\n    discount = 0.10;\n  }\n\n  const result = Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount));\n  return Math.round(result * 100) / 100;\n}\n\nfunction runSuite(fn: (price: number, customer: { loyaltyYears: number; isEmployee: boolean }) => number): boolean {\n  // Write your tests here.\n  // Do not call priceWithDiscount directly.\n  return false;\n}",
+    "solution": "function priceWithDiscount(price: number, customer: { loyaltyYears: number; isEmployee: boolean }): number {\n  if (!Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0) {\n    throw new Error(\"Invalid price\");\n  }\n\n  let discount = 0;\n\n  if (customer.isEmployee) {\n    discount = 0.30;\n  } else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) {\n    discount = 0.15;\n  } else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 3) {\n    discount = 0.10;\n  }\n\n  const result = Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount));\n  return Math.round(result * 100) / 100;\n}\n\nfunction runSuite(fn: (price: number, customer: { loyaltyYears: number; isEmployee: boolean }) => number): boolean {\n  try {\n    const user = (loyaltyYears: number) => ({ loyaltyYears, isEmployee: false });\n    const employee = (loyaltyYears: number) => ({ loyaltyYears, isEmployee: true });\n\n    const assertEqual = (actual: unknown, expected: unknown) => {\n      if (!Object.is(actual, expected)) {\n        throw new Error(`Expected ${String(expected)}, received ${String(actual)}`);\n      }\n    };\n\n    const assertThrowsInvalidPrice = (price: number) => {\n      let threw = false;\n      try {\n        fn(price, user(0));\n      } catch (error) {\n        threw = error instanceof Error && error.message === \"Invalid price\";\n      }\n\n      if (!threw) {\n        throw new Error(\"Expected Invalid price error\");\n      }\n    };\n\n    assertEqual(fn(100, user(0)), 100);\n    assertEqual(fn(100, user(2)), 100);\n    assertEqual(fn(100, user(3)), 90);\n    assertEqual(fn(100, user(9)), 90);\n    assertEqual(fn(100, user(10)), 85);\n    assertEqual(fn(100, employee(0)), 70);\n    assertEqual(fn(100, employee(10)), 70);\n    assertEqual(fn(19.99, user(0)), 19.99);\n    assertEqual(fn(19.99, user(3)), 17.99);\n    assertEqual(fn(0, user(0)), 0);\n    assertEqual(fn(0, employee(0)), 0);\n    assertEqual(fn(1, employee(0)), 0.7);\n    assertEqual(fn(0.01, user(10)), 0.01);\n\n    assertThrowsInvalidPrice(-1);\n    assertThrowsInvalidPrice(-100);\n    assertThrowsInvalidPrice(Infinity);\n    assertThrowsInvalidPrice(-Infinity);\n    assertThrowsInvalidPrice(NaN);\n\n    return true;\n  } catch {\n    return false;\n  }\n}",
+    "hint": "Rozmýšľaj ako mutačný tester: každé dôležité pravidlo potrebuje aspoň jednu aserciu, ktorá by zlyhala, keby sa pravidlo nenápadne zmenilo. Otestuj najmä presne 3 a presne 10 rokov vernosti, zamestnanca s rokmi vernosti aj bez nich, hodnotu ako 19.99, ktorá si po zľave vyžaduje zaokrúhlenie, a vstupy záporné, Infinity a NaN. Výnimky zachytávaj vo vnútri runSuite a vráť false, keď ktorákoľvek asercia zlyhá.",
+    "tests": [
+      {
+        "name": "Správna implementácia prejde sadou",
+        "code": "return runSuite(priceWithDiscount) === true;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Zachytí chybu na hranici troch rokov",
+        "code": "function broken(price, customer) { if (!Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0) throw new Error(\"Invalid price\"); let discount = 0; if (customer.isEmployee) discount = 0.30; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) discount = 0.15; else if (customer.loyaltyYears > 3) discount = 0.10; const result = Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount)); return Math.round(result * 100) / 100; } return runSuite(broken) === false;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Zachytí chybu s chýbajúcim zaokrúhlením",
+        "code": "function broken(price, customer) { if (!Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0) throw new Error(\"Invalid price\"); let discount = 0; if (customer.isEmployee) discount = 0.30; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) discount = 0.15; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 3) discount = 0.10; return Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount)); } return runSuite(broken) === false;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Zachytí chybu so zľavou pre zamestnancov",
+        "code": "function broken(price, customer) { if (!Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0) throw new Error(\"Invalid price\"); let discount = 0; if (!customer.isEmployee && customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) discount = 0.15; else if (!customer.isEmployee && customer.loyaltyYears >= 3) discount = 0.10; const result = Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount)); return Math.round(result * 100) / 100; } return runSuite(broken) === false;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Zachytí chybu so zápornou cenou",
+        "code": "function broken(price, customer) { let discount = 0; if (customer.isEmployee) discount = 0.30; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) discount = 0.15; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 3) discount = 0.10; const result = Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount)); return Math.round(result * 100) / 100; } return runSuite(broken) === false;"
+      },
+      {
+        "name": "Zachytí chýbajúcu validáciu nekonečných hodnôt",
+        "code": "function broken(price, customer) { if (price < 0) throw new Error(\"Invalid price\"); let discount = 0; if (customer.isEmployee) discount = 0.30; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 10) discount = 0.15; else if (customer.loyaltyYears >= 3) discount = 0.10; const result = Math.max(0, price * (1 - discount)); return Math.round(result * 100) / 100; } return runSuite(broken) === false;"
+      },
