+    "solution": "function App() {\n  const [page, setPage] = React.useState(\"home\");\n  const [selectedTask, setSelectedTask] = React.useState(null);\n\n  function goTo(nextPage) {\n    setPage(nextPage);\n    setSelectedTask(null);\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <nav>\n        <button\n          onClick={() => goTo(\"home\")}\n          aria-current={page === \"home\" ? \"page\" : undefined}\n        >\n          Home\n        </button>\n        <button\n          onClick={() => goTo(\"tasks\")}\n          aria-current={page === \"tasks\" ? \"page\" : undefined}\n        >\n          Tasks\n        </button>\n        <button\n          onClick={() => goTo(\"about\")}\n          aria-current={page === \"about\" ? \"page\" : undefined}\n        >\n          About\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n\n      <main>\n        {page === \"home\" && <h1>Welcome</h1>}\n\n        {page === \"tasks\" && (\n          <>\n            <h1>Tasks</h1>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                <button onClick={() => setSelectedTask(\"Buy milk\")}>Buy milk</button>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <button onClick={() => setSelectedTask(\"Write tests\")}>Write tests</button>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            {selectedTask && (\n              <p data-testid=\"detail\">Task: {selectedTask}</p>\n            )}\n          </>\n        )}\n\n        {page === \"about\" && <h1>About</h1>}\n      </main>\n    </>\n  );\n}",
+    "hint": "Aktuálnu stránku drž v jednej stavovej premennej a vnútri main použi podmienené vykresľovanie. Pre názov vybranej úlohy použi druhú hodnotu stavu a vymaž ju vždy, keď sa zmení navigácia. Pri aktívnom tlačidle nastav aria-current na page iba vtedy, keď jeho stránka zodpovedá aktuálnemu stavu; inak odovzdaj undefined, aby atribút chýbal.",
